OL,3,GNEWSAM&S worker trying to stop shop
OL,4,Atheft hit by e-bike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was injured when a suspect rode
OL,7,Fan e-bike into a shop, picked up about
OL,8,F#200 worth of children's clothes before
OL,9,Fknocking a staff member to the ground.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said it was
OL,12,Finformed at about 11:45 GMT on Sunday
OL,13,Fthat the suspect had ridden into the
OL,14,FMarks and Spencer (M&S) in Giltbrook,
OL,15,FNottinghamshire.
OL,17,FA member of staff went to block the
OL,18,Fexit, but was struck by the bike and
OL,19,Fdragged along the ground before
OL,20,Fmanaging to halt the rider and bring
OL,21,Fthem and the stock back inside.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
